# "Skeletons you control and other Zombies you control get +1/+1 and have deathtouch" (CR 613.1f, 205.3m): Bot1's Skeleton Archer (a Skeleton) and
# Walking Corpse (a Zombie) are 4/4 and 3/3 with deathtouch; Death Baron itself, a Zombie Wizard, gets nothing ("other"), and Bot2's Walking
# Corpse (not "you control") is a plain 2/2. When the Baron leaves, the bonuses go.

